<!--
  The public, indexable surface. Deliberately excludes the application itself: every
  extension-less path there returns the same SPA shell, so listing them would submit a set
  of identical documents.

  /pricing is missing on purpose: it is a client-side route served from app.html, which
  sends `robots: noindex`. Submitting it here would ask Google to index a page that refuses
  to be indexed. Making the pricing page findable means giving it its own static HTML.

  This is short because the site is short — which is the finding, not the fix. Ranking for
  anything competitive needs pages that answer specific questions, and those do not exist
  yet.
-->
